
# Cerise

> Cerise is a small-batch brand founded by longtime friends Ashley Steen and Alyssa "Magda" Alward. We make hand block-printed quilted cotton housecoats and source one-of-a-kind vintage blankets, inspired by our travels. Designed in Venice, CA and Richmond, VA.

## About Cerise

Cerise is an independent, small-batch brand inspired by travel, textiles, and one-of-a-kind finds. Founded by longtime friends Ashley Steen and Alyssa "Magda" Alward, the brand designs in Venice, California, and Richmond, Virginia.

## Products

### The Cerise Housecoat — $295

Hand block-printed and sewn in India from 100% cotton with AZO-free dyes. Designed with an oversized comfort fit, a padded belt, and deep pockets.

- Colors: Clementine Violet and Burgundy Blue
- Lengths: Petite and Regular

### Vintage Blankets — $200–$250

One-of-a-kind vintage blankets sourced by hand. Each blanket is unique and sold only once.

